@baseUri = http://localhost:8182/api

### Listar todos as orders
GET {{baseUri}}/orders HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json



### Criar uma nova order
POST {{baseUri}}/orders HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "status": "pending",
  "total": "150.50"
}


### Buscar um order por ID
GET {{baseUri}}/orders/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Atualizar um order existente
PUT {{baseUri}}/orders/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "status": "paid",
  "total": "150.50"
}

### Deletar um order
DELETE {{baseUri}}/orders/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json